            "review_title": "Review at Ga Com Nuong",
            "review_text": "Wayland C\nNew York City, New York225 contributions\n0\nGood chicken, slow service\nFeb 2016 • Solo\nI had to try to flag down the waiters several times to order. The saving grace is that I like chicken and cheese. I noticed this restaurant in the after when I was walking by. They had at least 10 chicken rotating on a rotisserie. I made a mental note to go eat there at night. By the time I went at night, all the half and whole chickens were gone. The only dish available is loose boneless chicken pieces with cheese. Spent 210,000 VND and was still hungry afterwards. Ended going to KFC to fill my stomach.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 8, 2016",
